{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25816","headline":"新楼诗二十首 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲怜湖水通宵望，不学樊杨却月楼。\n惟待素规澄满镜，莫看纤魄挂如钩。\n卷帘方影侵红烛，绕竹斜晖透碧流。\n萧瑟晓风闻木落，此时何异洞庭秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}